cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "eo_water: field-scale evapotranspiration and drought stress from Sentinel-2 and Sentinel-3 (Po Delta, 2022)"
authors:
  - family-names: Marino
    given-names: Giovanni
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/giovmar-source/eo_water"
keywords:
  - evapotranspiration
  - thermal sharpening
  - TSEB
  - Sentinel-2
  - Sentinel-3
  - drought
  - Po Delta
abstract: >-
  Open-source chain that sharpens Sentinel-3 land surface temperature to 20 m with
  Sentinel-2, runs the TSEB-PT energy balance model and maps daily evapotranspiration
  and crop water stress. Validated on 10 Landsat dates (median r 0.51 to 0.86) and
  applied to the 2022 drought in the Po Delta (summer ET -28 to -39 % vs 2023-2025).
